  <entry>
    <id>ess/source-driven-realization-0.19.0</id>
    <title>Checked schema imports and structural data realizations</title>
    <updated>2026-09-05T21:00:00Z</updated>
    <link href="https://github.com/beyond10x/ess/releases/tag/0.19.0"/>
    <summary>Import complete JSON Schema roots with source identity; generate structural Go, Rust and TypeScript libraries; and run source-pinned normalization recipes. Rust normalization has a library API; Go/TypeScript support is pending. Rust/Web synthesis returns checked failures, and sliced provenance names its digest profile.</summary>
  </entry>
